<title>SWEDEN: Skanska wins 1.8bln Skr Finnish road order.</title>
<headline>Skanska wins 1.8bln Skr Finnish road order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction company Skanska said on Wednesday it had won a 1.8 billion crown order from Finnish road authority FINNRA to build a motorway in Finland.</p>
</text>
